meta {
  name: 3. Dispute Session (A)
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/chat-sessions/{{sessionId}}/dispute
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  X-Telegram-Init-Data: {{initData}}
}

docs {
  Only the participant who did NOT close it can dispute (User A here,
  since "2. Close Session" used User B) — 400 otherwise. Only works
  while CLOSED and still within chat_release_grace_hours of closing.
  Freezes the transaction (Transaction.disputed_at) so the grace-period
  auto-release skips it — check Wallet > "3. Get Balance (A)" to confirm
  pending_toman stays put even well past the grace window.

  Skip this request entirely to test the normal, undisputed path
  instead.
}
